        " *   - Approvals: list_approvals, approve, reject",
        " *   - Knowledge: kb_search, kb_read",
        " *   - Navigation: navigate",
        " *   - Watchlist: watch, unwatch, list_watched",
        " *   - Context: focus_that, forget_context",
        " *   - Pause / resume / voice mode",
